<title>BANGLADESH: Bangladesh truck crash kills 15.</title>
<headline>Bangladesh truck crash kills 15.</headline>
<dateline>DHAKA 1996-12-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>At least 15 people were killed and 25 injured when a sand-laden truck overturned in thick fog on the Dhaka-Mymenshigh highway, 60 miles (100 km) east of the capital Dhaka, police said on Sunday.</p>
<p>Police said the truck was carrying 40 construction workers when it overturned early on Saturday.</p>
<p>The dead were buried under the sand, police said.</p>
</text>
